<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net9.0;net10.0;net11.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <RootNamespace>Pdfwright</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>Pdfwright</AssemblyName>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Label="Package">
    <PackageId>Pdfwright</PackageId>
    <Description>A small, MIT-licensed PDF writer for reports: paragraphs and tables with pagination, vector drawing, embedded font subsets, right-to-left and mixed-direction text, and Arabic, Indic and Thai shaping through HarfBuzz. Tables stream their rows, headers and footers know the page count, and a drawing canvas and a text measurer serve charts. Fonts are supplied by the caller, never looked up in the operating system, and the text of the file reads back in logical order.</Description>
    <PackageTags>pdf;report;pdf-writer;pdf-generation;table;pagination;harfbuzz;rtl;bidi;arabic;hebrew;devanagari;thai;complex-scripts</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
0.1.2: PdfImage.FromBytes reads WebP pictures (lossy, lossless and with alpha; an animated WebP is refused), decoded in managed code with no new dependency. Files are much smaller (a 1,000-row table: 514 KB to 76 KB) with the same glyph positions, and writing a page allocates about half as much; the text reads back as before.

0.1.1: a line break or another control character in a string no longer makes a save throw. Every line break (\n, \r\n, \r, U+0085, U+000B, U+000C, U+001C to U+001E, U+2028, U+2029) is a hard line break inside the same block, everywhere text is laid out (canvas text included); other control characters are removed; a lone surrogate becomes U+FFFD; metadata, font family and language strings are trimmed and cleaned. Text without these characters is written as before.

0.1.0, the first release: a PDF writer for reports. Blocks (Heading, Paragraph, Table, ItemList, Columns, Callout, Drawing, Image) flow and paginate; tables stream their rows and repeat the header; a drawing canvas and a text measurer serve charts; headers and footers know the page count; fonts are supplied by the caller and embedded as subsets; right-to-left and mixed-direction text, and Arabic, Hebrew, Devanagari, Bengali, Tamil and Thai shaping through HarfBuzz, are written in logical order so the text can be searched and copied; output is deterministic; SaveAsync can be cancelled; PdfImageOptions limits picture size (40 megapixels by default).

Known limitations (0.1.x): the language review of the test text was made by an AI agent, not by native speakers (Tamil, Bengali, Thai and Marathi least certain); the viewer check was PDFium renders, and Acrobat Reader and macOS Preview were not checked; the output-size target is met but the speed and memory targets are missed (docs/baselines.md); CJK fonts with TrueType outlines are accepted but not tested, and fonts with CFF outlines (Noto Sans CJK, Source Han) are not supported yet.

Full notes: https://github.com/sinanoran/pdfwright/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="HarfBuzzSharp" />
    <PackageReference Include="HarfBuzzSharp.NativeAssets.Linux" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- The README that is packed is the repository's README with its relative links made absolute (see the target below). The licence is the MIT expression of the package; the text and the notice of what Pdfwright uses travel beside it. -->
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\NOTICE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- nuget.org shows the packed README away from the repository, so a relative link such as docs/guide.md would not work there. One README stays the only source:
       the packed copy is made from it at pack time, with each relative link made a link into the repository on GitHub (an image as its raw file). -->
  <Target Name="WritePackageReadme" BeforeTargets="_GetPackageFiles;GenerateNuspec">
    <PropertyGroup>
      <ReadmeBlob>https://github.com/sinanoran/pdfwright/blob/main/</ReadmeBlob>
      <ReadmeRaw>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sinanoran/pdfwright/main/</ReadmeRaw>
      <ReadmeText>$([System.IO.File]::ReadAllText('$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\..\..\README.md'))</ReadmeText>
      <ReadmeText>$([System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex]::Replace('$(ReadmeText)', '(!\[[^\]]*\]\()(?!https?:|#|mailto:)([^)\s]+)\)', '$1$(ReadmeRaw)$2)'))</ReadmeText>
      <ReadmeText>$([System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex]::Replace('$(ReadmeText)', '\]\((?!https?:|#|mailto:)([^)\s]+)\)', ']($(ReadmeBlob)$1)'))</ReadmeText>
      <PackageReadmePath>$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\$(IntermediateOutputPath)package-readme\README.md</PackageReadmePath>
    </PropertyGroup>
    <WriteLinesToFile File="$(PackageReadmePath)" Lines="$([MSBuild]::Escape('$(ReadmeText)'))" Overwrite="true" Encoding="UTF-8" />
    <ItemGroup>
      <None Include="$(PackageReadmePath)" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    </ItemGroup>
  </Target>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Pdfwright.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Pdfwright.Benchmarks" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Pdfwright.NativeProbe" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
